Python dependencies
================================================================================

Explorer depends on, but does not redistribute, the packages pinned in
requirements.txt — FastAPI, Starlette, uvicorn, boto3/botocore, Jinja2,
bleach, itsdangerous, python-dotenv, python-multipart and cryptography.
Each is installed from PyPI at build time under its own license (BSD-3-Clause,
MIT or Apache-2.0). Run `pip-licenses` in your build environment for the
authoritative list of the exact versions you installed.
